{"product_id":"nasty-podmate-nic-salt-red-rage","title":"Nasty PodMate Nic Salt - Red Rage","description":"\u003cp\u003eRed Rage nic salt by Nasty Juice Podmate is a bubbly blend of mixed fruits and energy drink. You’ll get bold mixed fruit flavours on the inhale, followed by a fizzy energy drink profile on the exhale.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNasty Juice Podmate e-liquids are designed for low powered mouth to lung devices. Nic salts deliver a higher level of nicotine that are also more readily absorbed meaning you can keep those cravings at bay. They have the added bonus of a mild throat hit and still providing the exceptional flavour you expect from this brand.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePackage Contents Include:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 x 30ml bottle of Red Rage Nasty Podmate Salt\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVG\/PG: 50\/50\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlavor Profile: Energy Drink\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41807769632823,"sku":"Nasty PodMate - Red Rage - 50 mg","price":1600.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"35mg","offer_id":41807769665591,"sku":"Nasty PodMate - Red Rage - 35 mg","price":1600.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Nasty-Red-Rage_podmate.webp?v=1754266831","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/nasty-podmate-nic-salt-red-rage","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




